{
  "description": "Bulk-size sweep — holds ef_c=64/m=16 (recommended config from index parameter sweep) fixed and varies target_index_bulk_size across 6 values: 100, 500, 1000, 2500, 5000, 10000. Spacing is geometric to capture the steep low-end gains and confirm the plateau at the high end. 5000 is the existing control point from builds #100 and #156. Measures effective ingest throughput, P99 ingest latency, and segment count. Search (k=10, k=100) confirms recall is not affected by bulk_size.",
